[FINAL-TEXT] **Found it.** The arping test is definitive:

- `laptop0 → arping 172.16.10.13 (laptop3)`: **100% TIMEOUT** — 3/3 ARP broadcasts unanswered  
- `laptop3 → arping 172.16.10.12 (laptop2)`: **100% answered** — same-VLAN ARP works  
